formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-p2-story", "tabName": "Story", "description": "", "headings": [{"id": "h-0uox0cu", "name": "In the Beginning Yahweh wanted a Family to love", "paragraphs": [{"id": "19", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0, "title": "", "columns": [{"id": "20", "rowId": "19", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "", "text": "<img class=\"col-pic\" src=\"/sites/sons-of-god-arise/images/Image-1-e1759421906895.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px 0 0px 0\" />", "width": 1, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}]}, {"id": "r-usw9juf", "columns": [{"id": "3", "rowId": "r-usw9juf", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "", "text": "Before everything existed, Yahweh wanted to dwell with a human family in the garden of Eden.<span class=\"fn\"> </span> Love would the only language spoken in His presence.<span class=\"fn\"> 1 </span>\n\nGod, who's name is Yahweh, planned that Eden would be filled with human beings and cover the whole earth. The Paradise of God where heaven and earth were together, forever with the Tree of Life.<span class=\"fn\"> 2 </span>", "width": 347.453125, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "4", "rowId": "r-usw9juf", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "", "text": "<span class=\"fn\">1</span><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Eph 1:3-6\">Eph 1:3-6</a>\n\n<span class=\"fn\">2</span><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Rev 2:7\">Rev 2:7</a>", "width": 80.5625, "format": "Text Middle", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "title": "", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "r-8c2ynq6", "title": "", "columns": [{"id": "5", "rowId": "r-8c2ynq6", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "", "text": "However, there is something left out of that account.  When Yahweh finished creating the earth the sons of God were watching rejoicing - they were spiritual beings watching from heaven.<span class=\"fn\"> 3 </span> They are spiritual beings who exist in the heavenly places, with God and where God is, they will be too.  So God's plan to dwell with mankind in Paradise forever, will include spiritual beings - God's spiritual family.<span class=\"fn\"></span>", "width": 352.015625, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "6", "rowId": "r-8c2ynq6", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "", "text": "<span class=\"fn\">3</span><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#ref\" data-ref=\"Job 38:4-7\">Job 38:4-7</a>", "width": 80, "format": "Text Middle", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "order": 2, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "r-jhfhiie", "columns": [{"id": "7", "rowId": "r-jhfhiie", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "", "text": "<img class=\"col-pic\" src=\"/sites/sons-of-god-arise/images/garden-of-eden-adam-eve-tree-of-life.jpg\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px 0 0px 0\" />", "width": 160, "format": "Photo", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "8", "rowId": "r-jhfhiie", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "", "text": "Yahweh planted a garden for Adam and Eve, called Eden, the Paradise of God, where they walked with Him. There was the tree of life in the midst of the garden and everything was very good.\n\nYahweh had chosen to start with one couple, and all their descendants would fill the earth - every one of them created in His image. Yahweh gave each one the opportunity to serve as His ambassador, tending and keeping His garden.", "width": 687, "format": "Text Left", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "title": "", "order": 3, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-p2-qa", "tabName": "Q&A", "description": "", "headings": [{"id": "h-xa3eto1", "name": "Eden’s Symbolism", "paragraphs": [{"id": "r-fgx6ojv", "columns": [{"id": "9", "rowId": "r-fgx6ojv", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "", "text": "photo", "width": 119, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "10", "rowId": "r-fgx6ojv", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "Let US make MANKIND in our image", "text": "Does ‘mankind’ mean the whole human race? To whom was God talking when He said, \"Let us\"? When are believers finally made in the image of God?", "width": 727, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "r-tscdkju", "columns": [{"id": "11", "rowId": "r-tscdkju", "order": 0, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "", "text": "photo", "width": 121, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}, {"id": "12", "rowId": "r-tscdkju", "order": 1, "editedAt": 1787558349948, "title": "", "text": "Let US make MANKIND in our image Does ‘man’ mean Adam or mankind? To whom was God talking when He said, \"Let us\"? When are believers finally made in the image of God?", "width": 725, "format": "Default", "titleFormat": "Default"}], "formatNames": {"paragraph": "Default", "columnTitle": "Default", "columnText": "Default"}, "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 0, "editedAt": 0}], "formatName": "Default", "order": 2, "editedAt": 0}, {"id": "s-b7wst1g", "tabName": "Settings", "description": "", "headings": [], "settings": true, "order": 3, "editedAt": 0}], "formatNames": {"website": "Default", "pageTitle": "Default"}, "order": 1, "editedAt": 0}], "siteFormat": {"website": {"font": "Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif", "size": "22", "color": "#1f6f78", "background": "#f6f7eb", "borderColor": "#c5d0d4", "borderWidth": "1", "sides": {"t": false, "r": false, "b": false, "l": false}, "shadow": false, "shadowX": "0", "shadowY": "2", "shadowBlur": "6", "shadowCo